From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:35:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 47/51] Guide: Personal Settings > Themes

hud.xex's SkinSelect / OptionsPersonalization / DashStyleSelect /
TileSelect / ColorSelect scenes as half-width Guide pages: built-in
themes (DashStyle file, Guide background, ThematicSkin removed,
notification 0x8000000F), dashboard trims, Guide Background tiles and
Custom Color sliders (10-255). The background is kept in the dashboard
GPD (record section 6, id 0x8003, as xam 818D6058 passes it).

The Guide's images for a chosen background are rendered in the
background (guide_look_python / guide_look_script) and the Guide
switches to them once ready; the console changes at once.

